# VehiclesApp

A .NET Core Razor Pages web application that allows users to select a vehicle make and manufacture year and view the available vehicle types and models.

## Technologies

* ASP.NET Core Razor Pages
* C#
* HTML, CSS, JavaScript
* Docker
* NHTSA vPIC API

## NHTSA APIs

* **Get All Makes**
  `https://vpic.nhtsa.dot.gov/api/vehicles/getallmakes?format=json`

* **Get Vehicle Types**
  `https://vpic.nhtsa.dot.gov/api/vehicles/GetVehicleTypesForMakeId/{makeId}?format=json`

* **Get Models by Make and Year**
  `https://vpic.nhtsa.dot.gov/api/vehicles/GetModelsForMakeIdYear/makeId/{makeId}/modelyear/{year}?format=json`

## Run Locally

### Requirements

* .NET SDK
* Git
* Docker (if running with Docker)

### Using .NET

Clone the repository:

```bash
git clone <repository-url>
cd VehiclesApp
```

Run the application:

```bash
dotnet restore
dotnet run
```

Open the URL shown in the terminal.

## Run with Docker

Build the Docker image:

```bash
docker build -t vehiclesapp .
```

Run the container:

```bash
docker run -d -p 8080:8080 --name vehiclesapp vehiclesapp
```

Open:

```text
http://localhost:8080
```

## Example

Select **BMW**, enter **2015**, and click **Search Vehicles** to view the available vehicle types and models.

## AWS

The application is Dockerized and can be deployed on an AWS EC2 instance.
